---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = 'October 30, 2026';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service — Rank Labs" description="The terms that govern Rank Labs services: plans and fees, billing, cancellation, ownership of your site and content, and what we do and do not guarantee.">

<section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-sm text-cyan-300 font-mono mb-4">LEGAL</div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Terms of <span class="gradient-text">Service</span></h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-10">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-muted leading-relaxed">

      <div>
        <p>
          These terms govern the services Rank Labs, LLC provides to you. By signing up, paying an
          invoice, or using getranklabs.com, you agree to them. If you are agreeing on behalf of a
          company, you confirm you are authorised to do so.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. The services</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">We offer two plans.</p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          <strong class="text-white">Rank Labs Visibility Report — $499/month, month-to-month.</strong>
          Reporting only. We audit your site, track keywords and AI engine visibility, and send you
          the findings. <strong class="text-white">We make no changes to your site on this plan</strong>
          — you implement the fixes.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-white">Full Management — $2,500/month.</strong> Everything in the
          report, and we implement the fixes. We also build, host and maintain your site.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">2. Fees, billing and the current offer</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 ml-5 list-disc mb-4">
          <li>Fees are in US dollars and are billed monthly in advance through Stripe.</li>
          <li>Full Management carries a one-time $1,000 migration fee on a month-to-month term.</li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-white">On a 6-month contract, the first month is free and the
            $1,000 migration fee is waived.</strong> If you cancel a 6-month contract before the
            six months are served, the waived migration fee and the value of the free month become
            payable.
          </li>
          <li>Late or failed payments may pause the service until the balance is settled.</li>
          <li>Fees exclude taxes, which are added where applicable.</li>
          <li>We may change our prices with 30 days' written notice. Your current term is unaffected.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Payments are processed by Stripe. Card details go directly to Stripe and we never receive
          or store them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. Term and cancellation</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Month-to-month plans may be cancelled at any time, effective at the end of the month you
          have already paid for. A 6-month contract runs for its term, then continues
          month-to-month until cancelled.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not pro-rate partial months. We may suspend or end the service for non-payment, or
          for any use that breaches section 6.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">4. What we do not guarantee</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          This matters, so we are putting it plainly.
          <strong class="text-white">We do not guarantee rankings, placements, citations, traffic,
          leads or revenue.</strong> Nobody honestly can. Google, Bing, ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini and
          Perplexity each control their own ranking and citation behaviour, change it without
          notice, and do not accept payment from us for placement.
        </p>
        <p>
          What we commit to is the work itself: the audits, tracking, reporting and
          implementation described in your plan, performed to a professional standard and on the
          cadence we have stated. Any figure we show you is a measurement of what has already
          happened, not a forecast of what will.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">5. What you are responsible for</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 ml-5 list-disc">
          <li>Giving us the access we need — your site, analytics, search console and listings — and removing it when we stop working together.</li>
          <li>The accuracy of the business information, content and claims you ask us to publish.</li>
          <li>Holding the rights to anything you give us to publish, including images and trademarks.</li>
          <li>Reviewing drafts we send for approval. On Full Management, content you approve is published as approved.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">6. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>
          You may not use our services for anything unlawful, deceptive or infringing, and you may
          not ask us to publish content that is. We will not buy links, build spam networks,
          cloak content, or use any other technique that violates a search engine's or AI
          provider's published guidelines, even on request.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">7. Who owns what</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          <strong class="text-white">You own your site, your content and your domain.</strong> That
          includes the pages and posts we produce for you, once they are paid for. Nothing is
          locked into our platform, and on request we will hand over what we hold so you can move
          it elsewhere.
        </p>
        <p>
          We keep ownership of our own tooling — the auditing and crawling software, scoring
          methodology, templates and internal systems that produce the work. Nothing here grants
          you a licence to those beyond using the services.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">8. Confidentiality</h2>
        <p>
          Each of us may see the other's non-public information. Both of us agree to use it only
          to deliver or receive the services, and to protect it with at least reasonable care. We
          will not name you as a customer or publish your results without your permission.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">9. Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          The services depend on platforms we do not control, including search engines, AI
          providers, hosting, analytics and listing services. If one of them changes its rules,
          pricing or behaviour, we will tell you and adapt, but we are not liable for their
          decisions or outages.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">10. Disclaimer and limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          The services are provided "as is" and "as available". To the fullest extent the law
          allows, we disclaim implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular
          purpose and non-infringement.
        </p>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent the law allows, neither party is liable for indirect, incidental,
          special or consequential damages, or for lost profits, revenue or data. Our total
          liability arising out of these terms is limited to the fees you paid us in the three
          months before the claim arose. Nothing here limits liability that cannot lawfully be
          limited.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">11. Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Florida, without regard to its
          conflict-of-laws rules. The state and federal courts serving Orange County, Florida have
          exclusive jurisdiction, and both parties consent to that venue.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">12. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms. If a change is material we will email active customers at
          least 30 days beforehand. Continuing to use the services after a change takes effect
          means you accept it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">13. Everything else</h2>
        <p>
          If any provision is held unenforceable, the rest stays in force. A delay in enforcing a
          right is not a waiver of it. You may not assign these terms without our written consent;
          we may assign them to a successor of our business. These terms, plus any order or
          proposal you have signed, are the entire agreement between us.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gradient-border rounded-2xl p-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Rank Labs, LLC · Orlando, Florida, United States<br />
          <a href="mailto:hello@getranklabs.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">hello@getranklabs.com</a>
          · <a href="tel:+14077438964" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">(407) 743-8964</a>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
          See also our <a href="/privacy" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
